Third-party material
--------------------
data/schema.json (and its copy embedded in docs/index.html) contains
setting names, labels, tooltips, default values and process presets
derived from the Safe Exam Browser source code:

  Copyright (c) ETH Zurich, IT Services (and SEB contributors)
  Licensed under the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0
  https://github.com/SafeExamBrowser
  https://safeexambrowser.org

Sources used: SEB for Windows configurator (SEBSettings.cs,
SebWindowsConfigForm and Designer files), SEB for macOS (SEBSettings.m,
preference .xib files) and SEB for iOS (InAppSettings.bundle plists).

The file is generated by tools/extract_schema.py. The Mozilla Public
License 2.0 applies to it as to the rest of this repository (see LICENSE);
the original copyright notices above must be preserved.

The .seb file format is described by SEB's public documentation. The
encryption code (RNCryptor v3 compatible) is an independent
implementation written for this project.
